# recursive interpolation not allowed

输出 写入: 
['recursive string interolation enabled: '] + (
	程序 功能: 
	['RECURSIVE_STRINTPOL']
), 停止.


>> a := ['hello world'].
a := a world: ['yellow'].
a := a ll: ['xxx'].

输出 写入: a, 停止.


程序 功能: ['RECURSIVE_STRINTPOL'] 启用: 是.

输出 写入: 
['recursive string interpolation enabled: '] + (
	程序 功能: 
	['RECURSIVE_STRINTPOL']
), 停止.

>> a := ['hello world'].
a := a world: ['yellow'].
a := a ll: ['xxx'].

输出 写入: a, 停止.

程序 功能: ['RECURSIVE_STRINTPOL'] 启用: 否.

输出 写入: 
['recursive string interpolation enabled: '] + (
	程序 功能: 
	['RECURSIVE_STRINTPOL']
), 停止.

>> a := ['hello world'].
a := a world: ['yellow'].
a := a ll: ['xxx'].

输出 写入: a, 停止.
